<title>UK: Troubled Greenhills brings in liquidator.</title>
<headline>Troubled Greenhills brings in liquidator.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British themed restaurant operator Greenhills Plc said on Friday that it had appointed a liquidator following its move into receivership last December.</p>
<p>In a brief statement it said Ray Hocking of BDO Stoy Hayward would be its liquidator.</p>
<p>According to British press reports, the Department of Trade has included dealing in Greenhills shares in an ongoing inquiry into a suspected insider dealing ring linking London and Monaco.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
